    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The advanced <strong>Heading block</strong> is a powerful and versatile heading block that goes beyond the standard WordPress heading block. It offers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple heading levels (H1-H6)</li>\n<li>Advanced typography controls including font size, weight, and line height</li>\n<li>Eye-catching animation effects including flash, fade, and slide animations</li>\n<li>Customizable text and background colors</li>\n<li>Border and shadow styling options</li>\n<li>Responsive design with mobile-friendly controls</li>\n<li>Text alignment options</li>\n<li>Custom CSS class support</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for creating standout headlines, hero sections, and attention-grabbing titles that enhance your website&#8217;s visual appeal and user engagement.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/unique-heading-flash</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>The block will be available in the block editor under the &#8220;Text&#8221; category</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20change%20the%20heading%20level%3F'>\nHow do I change the heading level?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can change the heading level (H1-H6) using the toolbar controls when the block is selected, or through the block settings panel.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20the%20animation%20effects%3F'>\nCan I customize the animation effects?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! The block includes several animation options including flash effects, fade animations, and slide transitions. You can enable/disable and customize these through the block inspector panel.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20this%20block%20responsive%3F'>\nIs this block responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely! The block is built with responsive design in mind and will look great on all device sizes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20custom%20css%20with%20this%20block%3F'>\nCan I use custom CSS with this block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can add custom CSS classes through the advanced settings panel to further customize the block&#8217;s appearance.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "An advanced heading block with unique styling options",
    "description": "<p>The advanced <strong>Heading block</strong> is a powerful and versatile heading block that goes beyond the standard WordPress heading block. It offers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple heading levels (H1-H6)</li>\n<li>Advanced typography controls including font size, weight, and line height</li>\n<li>Eye-catching animation effects including flash, fade, and slide animations</li>\n<li>Customizable text and background colors</li>\n<li>Border and shadow styling options</li>\n<li>Responsive design with mobile-friendly controls</li>\n<li>Text alignment options</li>\n<li>Custom CSS class support</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for creating standout headlines, hero sections, and attention-grabbing titles that enhance your website&#8217;s visual appeal and user engagement.</p>\n",
